# CODEOWNERS - Defines code ownership for automated review requests
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners for all files (fallback)
* @org/maintainers @lead-developer

# Security team owns security-related files
/security/                    @org/security-team
**/security/**                @org/security-team
*.pem                         @org/security-team
*.key                         @org/security-team
**/auth/**                    @org/security-team
**/authentication/**          @org/security-team
**/authorization/**           @org/security-team

# Backend team owns services
/services/                    @org/backend-team
**/services/**                @org/backend-team

# Frontend team owns interfaces
/interfaces/                  @org/frontend-team
**/interfaces/**              @org/frontend-team

# DevOps team owns infrastructure and deployment
/devops/                      @org/devops-team
**/devops/**                  @org/devops-team
docker-compose*               @org/devops-team
Dockerfile*                   @org/devops-team
**/docker-compose*            @org/devops-team
**/Dockerfile*                @org/devops-team
/.github/workflows/           @org/devops-team
